後至，爭山不得上，趙奢縱兵撃之，大破秦軍。秦軍解而走，遂解閼與之圍而歸。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji081-016:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p012","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"軍士","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m012-0175","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"官名、角色及授任分存，各次將兵另列；首次用稱、病、逃亡、被俘或死亡不自動終止所有官爵，未明日期保持未定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"th-shiji081-018","person_id":"db0_yyf_4td","title":"國尉","kind":"office","mode":"grant","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p013","quote":"趙惠文王賜奢號爲馬服君，以許暦爲國尉。趙奢於是與廉頗、藺相如同位。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji081-018:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p013","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"國尉","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:m013-0013","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin","source_id":"s-shiji-081-lianlin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p013","quote":"趙惠文王賜奢號爲馬服君，以許暦爲國尉。趙奢於是與廉頗、藺相如同位。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"官名、角色及授任分存，各次將兵另列；首次用稱、病、逃亡、被俘或死亡不自動終止所有官爵，未明日期保持未定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji081-018","person_id":"db0_yyf_4td","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-081-lianlin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["許暦","軍士許暦"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-081-lianlin:p012","quote":"兵去邯鄲三十里，而令軍中曰：「有以軍事諫者死。」秦軍軍武安西，秦軍鼓譟勒兵，武安屋瓦盡振。軍中候有一人言急救武安，趙奢立斬之。堅壁，留二十八日不行，復益增壘。秦間來入，趙奢善食而遣之。間以報秦將，秦將大喜曰：「夫去國三十里而軍不行，乃增壘，閼與非趙地也。」趙奢既已遣秦間，巻甲而趨之，二日一夜至，今善射者去閼與五十裏而軍。軍壘成，秦人聞之，悉甲而至。軍士許暦請以軍事諫